using System;

namespace Sedulous.RHI.Vulkan.Tests;

/// Real SPIR-V for the pipeline tests, compiled from GLSL and embedded.
///
/// EMBEDDED rather than loaded from disk so the tests need no data path and cannot skip
/// for a missing file. They are the smallest shaders that still exercise what a pipeline
/// needs: a vertex stage with one input, a fragment stage with one output, and a compute
/// stage that writes a storage buffer through the UAV binding shift.
///
/// The word arrays are the .spv contents verbatim; a Vulkan driver rejects anything whose
/// first word is not the SPIR-V magic, so a mangled blob fails loudly.
static class TestShaders
{
